CHAPTER.VERS:
For this cause therefore I entreated you

          {+}
         to see and to speak with [me]: for because of the hope of Israel I have this chain around me.

And when they didn't agree among themselves, they departed after that Paul had spoken one word, Well did the Holy Spirit speak through Isaiah the prophet to your

          {+}
         fathers,

saying, Go to this people, and say, By hearing you

          {+}
         will hear, and will in no way understand; And seeing you

          {+}
         will see, and will in no way perceive:

Be it known therefore to you

          {+}
        , that this salvation of God is sent to the Gentiles: they will also hear.
